    answer: "The 12-month package is our flagship bestseller at 55 € per year (~4.16 €/month). It includes full access to all French live channels, unlimited VOD with French audio (VF/VOSTFR), our proprietary Anti-Freeze 9.8™ technology, a free permanent licence for our Premium Player application (15 € value), 24/7 WhatsApp VIP support, and a strict 24-hour money-back guarantee."
