              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#0055D4]/15 border border-[#0055D4]/30 text-[#60A5FA] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                <Globe2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
                Worldwide Access · Expats & France
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
                4K 60FPS Anti-Freeze 9.8™
              </span>
            </div>

            <!-- Single Page H1 Tag with Exact Primary Keyword Placement -->
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-6">
              The Best <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#60A5FA] via-[#FFFFFF] to-[#F87171]">French IPTV</span> <br />
              Subscription in 4K UHD
            </h1>

            <!-- Primary Keyword within First 75-100 Words -->
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 font-normal leading-relaxed mb-8">
              Experience the highest quality <strong>French IPTV</strong> streaming service worldwide. Whether you live in France or abroad in the UK, USA, Canada, Europe, or beyond, our high-speed network provides seamless access to French national channels, live sports tournaments with French commentary, and an extensive library of on-demand movies and series. Powered by our proprietary Anti-Freeze 9.8™ technology with 2-minute instant activation on WhatsApp.
            </p>

            <!-- Highlights Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 mb-8">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-200">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" />
                <span>100% French channels & live sport in 4K 60FPS</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-200">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" />
                <span>Anti-Freeze 9.8™ with 99.98% uptime guarantee</span>
              </div>
