              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                <Zap class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Low-Latency Global Edge CDN</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                  Direct optical peering with major internet exchanges in Paris (TH2), Frankfurt (DE-CIX), and London (LINX) ensures sub-10ms packet delivery and zero buffering.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#121424] border border-white/[0.08] flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                <Radio class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">French Commentary on All Major Sports</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                  Enjoy French Ligue 1, UEFA competitions, Top 14 Rugby, Formula 1, and tennis with passionate, native French audio commentary.
                </p>
